; ==========================================
; CHALLENGE 2: Rocket Launch Countdown
; Language: Khmer / ភាសាខ្មែរ (km)
; ==========================================
; Count down from 5 to 1, then launch!

រំកិល counter 5

launch_loop:
ការហៅប្រព័ន្ធ counter
ដក counter 1
ប្រៀបធៀប counter 0
if_different launch_loop

; Blastoff!
រំកិល box 999
ការហៅប្រព័ន្ធ box
